 points représentant les premiers termes d'une suite, rang n en abscisse, terme en ordonnée.\n```\n\nAu vu du graphique, cette suite semble-t-elle géométrique ?","variables":[{"name":"N","expression":"6|6"},{"name":"N1","expression":"7|7"},{"name":"c","expression":"1..4"},{"name":"u0","expression":"eval:c"},{"name":"u1","expression":"eval:1+c"},{"name":"u2","expression":"eval:4+c"},{"name":"u3","expression":"eval:9+c"}],"correction":{"steps":["On lit $u_0={{u0}}$, $u_1={{u1}}$, $u_2={{u2}}$ et $u_3={{u3}}$. $\\dfrac{u_1}{u_0}={{eval:(u1)/(u0)}}$ mais $\\dfrac{u_2}{u_1}={{eval:(u2)/(u1)}}$ : on ne multiplie pas toujours par le même nombre.","Attention : des points qui montent de plus en plus vite ne suffisent pas pour dire « géométrique ». La suite ne semble **pas géométrique**."]},"correctChoiceIndex":["1"]}],"shared":{"choices":[{"content":"Oui, elle semble géométrique."},{"content":"Non, elle ne semble pas géométrique."}]},"test_specs":[{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"N":"8","b":"-1","r":"2","N1":"9","u0":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"3","u3":"5"},"description":"v0 : « non » accepté","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"N":"8","b":"-1","r":"2","N1":"9","u0":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"3","u3":"5"},"description":"v0 : « oui » refusé","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"N":"8","b":"10","r":"3","N1":"9","u0":"10","u1":"7","u2":"4","u3":"1"},"description":"v1 : « non » accepté","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"N":"8","b":"10","r":"3","N1":"9","u0":"10","u1":"7","u2":"4","u3":"1"},"description":"v1 : « oui » refusé","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"N":"5","a":"1","N1":"6","u0":"1","u1":"2","u2":"4","u3":"8"},"description":"v2 : « oui » accepté","variationIndex":2,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"N":"5","a":"1","N1":"